        would rather understand the trade-off than be handed a single answer,
        because the right area for a couple on a long weekend in February is
        not the right area for a family of four in July. No hotel or apartment
        is named here — a room is a room, and the building you book will be
        different by the time you read this. The area will not.
      </p>
    </div>

